Dialogue: 50,0:01:51.97,0:01:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ne demek oluyor?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:54.43,0:01:56.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye buradasın?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.30,0:01:58.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trene nasıl bindin?!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.18,0:02:01.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tanrı aşkına...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.27,0:02:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasılsınız? \NBen, Keskin Nişancılar Kralı, Sogeking.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.48,0:02:08.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Konuşursam iş uzayabilir.\NKısaca seni kurtarmaya geldim.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.86,0:02:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uzun burun-kun...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece ben değil.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.86,0:02:17.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun ve haydut Franky,\Nsağı solu kırıp döküyorlar.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.45,0:02:20.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de fırsattan istifade buraya geldim.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.04,0:02:21.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffyler de...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.79,0:02:25.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ikinci bir deniz treniyle yola çıktı.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.00,0:02:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanında çok fazla yandaşı var.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.88,0:02:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya gelirken pencerelerden içeriye baktım.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:35.93,0:02:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arkamızdaki vagonda bulunan dört kişilik ekip çok tehlikeli.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:40.14,0:02:45.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun onlarla yüzleşmeden önce sizi buradan çıkarabilirsem iyi olur.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.19,0:02:53.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel ve...
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.74,0:02:55.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...benimle birlikte kaç.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.16,0:03:03.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun nedir?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.83,0:03:05.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Endişelenecek bir şey yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.83,0:03:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her şeyi hazırladım.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.29,0:03:10.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ahtapoterlikler senin için.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.38,0:03:16.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunlarla deniz treninin\Nyan tarafında yürüyebiliriz.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.26,0:03:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar farketmeden acele et.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.47,0:03:20.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.85,0:03:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu niye yapıyorsunuz?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.85,0:03:28.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizden ayrıldım.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.23,0:03:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tayfaya geri dönmeyeceğim!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.90,0:03:40.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes böyle yapma sebebini biliyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.95,0:03:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görünüşe göre tersanedeki\NBuz amca onlara her şeyi anlatmış.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O adam iyi mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.21,0:03:50.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.29,0:03:52.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine de...
Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.67,0:03:54.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...geri dönemem.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.51,0:03:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saçmalama!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.09,0:03:59.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hala anlamıyor musun?!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.01,0:04:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onları korumayı dert etmene gerek yok!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:01.76,0:04:07.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu aptal anlaşmayı yapmadan önce,\Nilk olarak onlarla konuşmalıydın!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.81,0:04:11.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta kalmak için...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.02,0:04:13.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...bir arkadaşlarını feda edeceklerine\Ngerçekten inandın mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.86,0:04:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık tayfadan niye ayrıldığını biliyorlar.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.44,0:04:21.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşmanların nerede saklanırsa saklansın,\Nonları bulup doğrayacaklar!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.12,0:04:25.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'nin nasıl bir adam olduğunu hala anlamadın mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.04,0:04:29.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu anlamayan sizlersiniz!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.79,0:04:32.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni kurtarmanızı asla istemedim.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.67,0:04:34.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstediğinizi yapamazsınız!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.63,0:04:37.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da ne şimdi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.76,0:04:41.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye bağırıyorsun, Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun nedir?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.10,0:04:52.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enies Lobby'ye yaklaştığımıza göre\Ngeleceğin için mi ağlıyorsun?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.61,0:04:55.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi geleceğin için ağlamanın manası yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.94,0:04:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık çok geç olduğunu biliyorsun, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.45,0:05:06.58,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Nedense burada bir terslik var.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.37,0:05:11.37,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa bana mı öyle geliyor?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.33,0:05:15.00,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece hayal mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:17.71,0:05:19.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun yok dedim.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.05,0:05:22.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni rahat bırak artık.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.97,0:05:27.18,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadında kesinlikle bir tuhaflık var.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.52,0:05:33.98,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Tavşan mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.32,0:05:41.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen Kenpo Dünyası'na hoş geldin!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.49,0:05:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne güçlenmesi?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.62,0:05:48.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Al bakalım!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.70,0:05:50.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Kenpo:
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.21,0:05:53.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tonkotsu* Spank!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:51.21,0:05:53.67,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Tonkotsu Şaplağı
Dialogue: 50,0:06:00.67,0:06:03.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sadece daha büyük bir yumruk.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.64,0:06:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sasasah! Bir tane daha!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:13.35,0:06:14.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıkıştım.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:33.62,0:06:34.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptalsın!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.79,0:06:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ramen kenpo'm seni şaşırttı, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.34,0:06:42.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle sıkışmışken \Nsüper gözükmek zor, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.51,0:06:48.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi demin yaptığını sana ödeteceğim.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.19,0:06:58.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pislik! Niye başın dönüyor?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.19,0:07:04.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir kez daha başımı döndürmek\Niçin şu kaşlarını kullanıyorsun.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.90,0:07:07.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu ödeyeceksin!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:14.08,0:07:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lanet olsun!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.79,0:07:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu şekilde dövüşemem!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.38,0:07:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Men Soul Press!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:22.38,0:07:25.22,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Erişte Ruh Presi!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.14,0:07:33.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine, yine!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.48,0:07:35.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Başka bir porsiyon!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.85,0:07:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekrar!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekrar!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.52,0:07:39.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekrar!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.86,0:07:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekrar!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.15,0:07:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,61)}Al şunu, bunu da, bunu da, bunu da ve bunu!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nihayet kurtuldum.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.75,0:08:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu beni küçük düşürdüğün için, seni aptal.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.54,0:08:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu, benim durdurulamaz ramen kenpo'mdu.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.92,0:08:09.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zırhına saldırırken sıkışacaksam,...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.43,0:08:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...ramene dokunmaktan kaçınmalıyım.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.27,0:08:16.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, hadi tempoyu artıralım!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen-Gyoza Set:
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.40,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Hamur Tatlısı Seti:
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.40,0:08:23.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Clapping!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.40,0:08:23.32,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Alkış
Dialogue: 50,0:08:26.94,0:08:30.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırabileceğim tek yer var.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Éscalope!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.74,0:08:36.62,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kemiksiz Et
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.00,0:08:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Beam!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.00,0:08:41.04,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Işını
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.76,0:08:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zayıf noktam yok.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.77,0:09:00.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dövüş tarzını çoktan anladım. \NSaldırmak için sadece bacaklarını kullanıyorsun.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.27,0:09:03.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekmelerini kilitlersem, işin biter.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.40,0:09:07.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşe yaramaz! İşe yaramaz!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.74,0:09:11.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yaparsan yap,\Nbu elbiseye takılacaksın!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu savuşturmayı dene.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.87,0:09:19.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ramen Kenpo:
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.41,0:09:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Fukumen Spank!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.41,0:09:21.67,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Çoklu Erişte Şaplağı
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.89,0:09:44.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,1.4 milimetrelik bir makarna, Fedelini*.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.44,0:09:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hokkabazlık...?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.44,0:09:51.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Erişte yumruklarımı parçalara ayırdın!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.16,0:09:59.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir aşçı kutsal ellerini veya\Nbıçaklarını kullanmadan dövüşmeli.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.91,0:10:02.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Benim dövüş politikam budur.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama mutfakta olduğumuza ve...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.92,0:10:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...sen yiyeceği silah olarak kullandığına\Ngöre, bu başka bir hikaye.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:12.59,0:10:15.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşündüğümden daha sinir bozucu gibi görünüyorsun.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.30,0:10:19.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Senmen Muchi!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.30,0:10:19.39,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bin Erişteli Kırbaç
Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.60,0:10:27.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Havalı görünmeye mi çalışıyorsun?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.06,0:10:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni küstah!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.57,0:10:32.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir çaylak mutfak bıçaklarıma dokunmamalı.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.28,0:10:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlar serseri amatörlerin oyuncakları değil.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.49,0:10:40.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Küstahlığım için afedersin.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:41.16,0:10:43.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu özrümün bir simgesi olarak kabul edin.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.38,0:10:48.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Göstermeme izin ver.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.84,0:10:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Birinci sınıf aşçının,...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:54.09,0:10:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Ustaca Bıçak Kullanma Yöntemi.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.56,0:11:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Soru!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.56,0:11:03.52,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kazı
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.56,0:11:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Strong Hammer!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.56,0:11:08.11,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Güçlü Çekiç
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kami-e.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.23,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kağıt Sanatı
