Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.38,0:11:35.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bilerek mi denize atladı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Geppo!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.09,0:11:37.55,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Ay Yürüyüşü
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.43,0:11:44.23,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Havadayken nasıl öyle geri atlayabildi?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.23,0:11:45.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlamıyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:46.31,0:11:48.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Rankyaku'm ona nasıl etki etmez?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.56,0:11:52.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu adamın bedeninde bir tuhaflık var.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:52.52,0:11:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lanet olası,...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.24,0:11:55.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tanrı aşkına,...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.91,0:12:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(414,1053)}...ne tür bir şeysin sen?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.91,0:12:04.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1374,1053)}...ne tür bir şeysin sen?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.00,0:12:11.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hala Passing (Geçen) Tom'a yetişemedik mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.09,0:12:12.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Puffing (Üfleyen).
Dialogue: 50,0:12:12.80,0:12:15.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baksana, Luffy. İçeri gir!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.38,0:12:18.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üstünü değiştirdin ama \Nyine sırılsıklam oldun!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.05,0:12:19.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorun değil!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada olmak hoşuma gidiyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.01,0:12:21.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öf...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.10,0:12:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gomu Gomu no...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.31,0:12:27.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}300 Pound'luk...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.02,0:12:28.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}– ...Top!\N– ...Top!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.44,0:12:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Bom!\N– Bom!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Foş!\N– Foş!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.40,0:12:32.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ahh! Buraya kadar, Laguna!\N– Ahh! Buraya kadar, Laguna!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.77,0:12:35.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir dakikalığına ciddi olamaz mısınız?!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:36.99,0:12:37.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sıkıldık.\N– Sıkıldık.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:37.99,0:12:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman kılıçlarınızı bileyin, \Nsizi aptallar.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.07,0:12:44.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey, ben...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.45,0:12:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...onları sonra azarlarım.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:51.00,0:12:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, çocuklar!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.25,0:12:55.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önümüzde bir tren var.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.22,0:13:00.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Üfleyen Tom bu!\N– Üfleyen Tom bu!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok erken!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kahretsin...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi ne yapacağız?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.35,0:13:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lokomotifimiz olmadığı için\Nkurtarılmayı beklemeliyiz.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.48,0:13:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oha! Sallanıyoruz!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.82,0:13:20.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu fırtına da yardım gelecek mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.28,0:13:23.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, beyler. \NArkamızdan gelen bir şey var.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.12,0:13:23.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:23.91,0:13:24.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurtarma gemisi mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.49,0:13:29.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayır, galiba raylarda hareket ediyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.21,0:13:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mümkün değil...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu dünyda sadece bir tane deniz treni var.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.71,0:13:38.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Üstelik trenimiz hareket ettikten sonra,\NWater Seven'dan ayrılmak mümkün olmamalı!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.30,0:13:41.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman...
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.39,0:13:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O nedir öyle?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.27,0:13:53.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Bu, lokomotifsiz bir deniz treni!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolu kapatıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.23,0:13:57.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu nasıl oldu?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.98,0:14:00.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trenden falan mı ayrılmış?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.44,0:14:04.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! Belki Sanji ve Usopp içindedir!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.11,0:14:06.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Belki Franky abi de!\N– Belki Franky abi de!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.66,0:14:07.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu hiç iyi değil!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.87,0:14:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu hızla gidersek, kesin çapacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.91,0:14:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nine, frenlere asıl!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.71,0:14:13.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İşe yaramıyor dedim, değil mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:13.83,0:14:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şeyler yapın.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.21,0:14:17.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çarpacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.80,0:14:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, ne yapıyoruz?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.63,0:14:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kontrol edeceğim!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.51,0:14:27.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gomu Gomu no Rocket!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.51,0:14:27.72,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Lastik-Lastik Roket
Dialogue: 50,0:14:30.72,0:14:31.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir şey uçuyor...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.65,0:14:37.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O da neydi?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.23,0:14:38.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nedir o?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.07,0:14:40.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu?!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.58,0:14:50.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, ah...
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.33,0:14:52.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam! Girdim!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.08,0:14:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Nesin sen?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.42,0:14:59.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji! Orada mısın?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.67,0:15:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! Sanji! Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.39,0:15:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Belki de orada.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:14.39,0:15:16.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu adam, olamaz!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.40,0:15:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapkalı Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.36,0:15:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,HEY!!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.07,0:15:31.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada mısın, Sanji?!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:33.79,0:15:35.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.12,0:15:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, kapayın çenenizi!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.29,0:15:42.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka, artık kaçamazsın!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji nerede?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O da kim?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.67,0:15:47.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Arkadaşım!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.93,0:15:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bilmiyoruz.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.14,0:15:51.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anladım...
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.64,0:15:52.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görüşürüz.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.64,0:15:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saldırın!!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-san çıkıyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.11,0:16:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada değiller diyor ve vuruluyor.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:08.11,0:16:11.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman o insanlar Hükümet'ten olmalı.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.12,0:16:14.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki şimdi ne yapıyoruz?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.33,0:16:17.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ondan kurtulmazsak, \Nbiz de tehlikede olacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu bir deniz treni!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.09,0:16:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yok olacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.80,0:16:31.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Darbeden ötürü patlayacağız!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.09,0:16:32.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman Franky Ailesi,...
Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.14,0:16:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...çarpmadan hemen önce onu parçalayacak.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:38.27,0:16:40.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam!! Biz de yardım edeceğiz!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.94,0:16:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyler, iş vakti!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.27,0:16:45.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Tamam!\N– Tamam!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.40,0:16:48.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.90,0:16:51.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Roronoa! Sana sesleniyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.70,0:16:54.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes onu! Bize engel oluyor!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.91,0:16:56.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tabii.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.87,0:16:58.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– "Tabii" mi?!\N– "Tabii" mi?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.68,0:17:12.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bozuk dünyanın benliği...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.76,0:17:15.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,..ikiyi ayrılır.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.65,0:17:27.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\t(2145,0,1,\c&H000000&)}Nitoryu Iai:
Dialogue: 50,0:17:23.65,0:17:27.32,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,0)\fs50}İki Kılıç Stili Kılıç Çekme:
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.66,0:17:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rashomon!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.66,0:17:38.41,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kale Kapısı
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?!\N– Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?!\N– Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.92,0:17:46.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?!\N– Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:02.77,0:18:04.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, siz!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.10,0:18:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu yapacağın zaman önceden söyle!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:06.69,0:18:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona kesmesini söylediğimi duymadınız mı?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.53,0:18:10.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Normalde öyle bir şeyin kesilebileceğine inanmayız!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.99,0:18:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kesmeseydik, çarpardık.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.74,0:18:17.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doğru da kalplerimiz hazır değildi!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:18.62,0:18:22.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korkunç derecede güçlü ve kaptan bile değil!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.04,0:18:26.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha bitmedi!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.05,0:18:29.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da ne böyle?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.42,0:18:31.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu bir deniz kralı!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.47,0:18:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu tren yolunun ilerisinde,...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.51,0:18:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...o şeyi kesen kişi var!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.02,0:18:53.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes öndeki vagonlara gitsin! \NBu bir tuzak!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.07,0:18:54.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,– Tuzak mı?!\N– Tuzak mı?!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.70,0:18:56.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.70,0:19:02.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düşmanın oyununa gelmek...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.87,0:19:04.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...utanç verici.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonsuz bir utanç.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.75,0:19:11.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2148,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Peki o zaman, beyler! İyi yolculuklar!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.38,0:19:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz trenine erişmeliyim.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.39,0:19:22.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eğer gözetim altında tutmamız gereken suçlular tekrar özgür kalırsa,...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.48,0:19:28.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...akacak masum kanının ve \Ngözyaşının haddi hesabı olmayacak.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.82,0:19:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlara bu adaletsiz dünyada bile adalet olduğunu göstereceğim!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.49,0:19:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dalgalar, bu kolları ve bacakları tüketse bile...
Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.28,0:19:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(3862,0,1,\c&H000000&)}...yarının masumlarını koruyacağım!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.12,0:20:21.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O da ne?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:25.50,0:20:27.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz treni mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.75,0:20:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeni bir deniz treni.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.76,0:20:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orada bir şey var.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.34,0:20:40.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha? O da ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:42.93,0:20:45.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orada biri var!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:48.81,0:20:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu Gemi Kesen!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.31,0:20:51.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ne?!\N– Ne?!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.31,0:20:53.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Ci-Ciddi misin??!\N– Ci-Ciddi misin??!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.06,0:20:54.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi Kesen mi?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:54.15,0:20:58.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O, Denizci Karargâhı'nda bir yüzbaşı,\NGemi Kesen T-Bone!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.11,0:21:01.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsan gemilerini biftek gibi kesen biri!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:01.36,0:21:02.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.32,0:21:03.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Müthiş!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.83,0:21:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Müthiş deme! Sanki başkasının sorunuymuş gibi konuşuyorsun!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:07.45,0:21:09.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu şekilde devam edemeyiz.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.33,0:21:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, çocuklar! \NTopları hazırlayın!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.54,0:21:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çabuk!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.46,0:21:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Tamam!\N– Tamam!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.76,0:21:22.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durun.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:23.26,0:21:24.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne oldu?!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.64,0:21:28.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acele etmezsek Roket Adam'ı doğrayacak!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.52,0:21:30.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deminden beri izlemiyor muydunuz?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu işi Zoro'ya bırakın.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.31,0:21:33.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karışmayın.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.28,0:21:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir kez söyleyeceğim!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:38.94,0:21:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolumuzdan çekil!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.49,0:21:47.62,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Adamlarımın olduğu vagonları geçmiş olamazlar.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.62,0:21:50.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Adamlarıma ne yaptılar?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.96,0:21:53.08,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin'in mürettebat arkadaşları olmalılar.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:53.63,0:21:56.96,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman, o adam,\N kılıç ustası Korsan Avcısı.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.71,0:22:01.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu yol adalet makamına giden yol.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.97,0:22:06.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben Deniz Karargahı'ndan bir yüzbaşıyım!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.51,0:22:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Utanç içinde yaşamayacağım!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.31,0:22:11.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi ikiye bölerek durduracağım!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.43,0:22:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buna müsaade edemem.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.81,0:22:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin durduğun yerin ötesini hedefliyoruz.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:20.61,0:22:22.32,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu adam güçlü.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.53,0:22:25.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hodri meydan!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.00,0:22:36.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hileli kılıç dövüşlerinden tiksiniyorum!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.38,0:22:38.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Chokkaku Hichou...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.38,0:22:38.09,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Doğru Açıyla Uçan...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.55,0:22:39.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Santouryuu:
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.55,0:22:39.96,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Üç Kılıç Stili:
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.96,0:22:41.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gyuki!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.96,0:22:41.38,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}İblis Boğa
Dialogue: 50,0:22:46.47,0:22:47.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bone...
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Oodori!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.60,0:22:49.43,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Yırtıcı Kuş
Dialogue: 50,0:23:06.03,0:23:07.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hareketimi anladı!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.87,0:23:09.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Yuzume!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.87,0:23:09.24,Attack,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cesur Pençe
Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.05,0:23:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gemi Kesen'i yendi!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:28.68,0:23:34.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu fırtınada, vagonlardan ayrılan \Ndeniz trenini takip ettiğini düşünmek...
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.23,0:23:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar takdire şayan!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:36.02,0:23:38.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık duramayız.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:39.86,0:23:45.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adaletinizin yükünün ağır olduğundan eminim\Nama bizim de omuzlarımızda ağır bir yük var..
Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.20,0:23:52.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çabuk! Çabuk olun!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.95,0:23:56.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzbaşı T-Bone denize düştü! Tehlikede!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:56.33,0:23:59.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakın onu da hakladılar demeyin.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.38,0:24:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Diline dikkat et, denizci!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.38,0:24:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yüzbaşı kesinlikle o \Ndeniz trenini ikiye bölmüştür!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.26,0:24:15.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Anlıyorum.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:15.52,0:24:20.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet. O vagonları muhtemelen Sanji-kun ayırdı.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:20.15,0:24:22.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman yakında ona erişecek miyiz?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:22.52,0:24:23.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Muhtemelen.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:23.57,0:24:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, düşmana yaklaşıyoruz.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:25.61,0:24:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.74,0:24:33.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hadi, Roket Adam!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:33.70,0:24:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O güvercin pisliğini haklayacağız!
